{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Europe2999 </strong>is a third-person shooter blending survival, storytelling, and total customization. Your mission: survive in a world where every faction wants to use you or crush you. Between back-alley deals, betrayals, and sudden battles, it\u2019s up to you to write your legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed groups, shadowy cults, local militias, and foreign powers all fight for influence. In this fragile balance, one mistake can cost you your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal survival:</strong> secure your treatment every two weeks, or face permanent death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A tense and dangerous world:</strong> explore a Mediterranean island on the brink of collapse, caught between the European Union and rival powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced third-person action:</strong> intense combat with a wide arsenal and vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique character:</strong> race, gender, appearance, clothes, everything is customizable. Go further by creating and commanding your own army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decisive choices:</strong> your decisions in dialogue and missions reshape the course of the story. Will you topple the established order or defend the island\u2019s fragile balance?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From survivor to power figure:</strong> trafficker, warlord, or free agent, write your own destiny.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078410?t=1760469708","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078410?t=1760469708","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078410/e5c99fef89e769a58c7b5430ed11a46ff8a5c4ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760469708","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a